    "pdp_faq": {
      "type": "glowve-pdp-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is barrier damage — and do I have it?",
            "answer": "<p>Your skin barrier is a protective layer of ceramides and lipids that keeps moisture in and irritants out. When it's damaged, skin feels tight after washing, looks dull, and becomes reactive to products it previously tolerated. <strong>Common triggers</strong>: over-cleansing, harsh actives, prolonged sun exposure, pollution, and dry weather.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use Soft Reset with retinol or acids?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — Soft Reset was formulated with this in mind. Apply your active (retinol, AHA, BHA) first, wait 60 seconds for it to absorb, then layer Soft Reset on top. It won't dilute your actives; it helps your skin tolerate them better and reduces the irritation that causes people to quit actives prematurely.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is Soft Reset suitable for oily or acne-prone skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Olivem 1000 is non-comedogenic and Niacinamide 5% actively reduces oiliness and visible pore size. <strong>Oily skin can have a damaged barrier too</strong> — it's often overlooked because people assume sebum production equals healthy skin. A damaged, oily barrier is a real and common condition.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How is Soft Reset different from other moisturisers?",
            "answer": "<p>Most moisturisers are occlusive films — they slow water loss but don't repair the barrier itself. Soft Reset contains <strong>ceramides identical to those found in human skin</strong>, plus Matrixyl 3000 for structural collagen support. It's designed to repair, not just cover over the problem.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it work in Pakistan's climate?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — it was formulated with the Pakistani climate in mind. The ceramide complex is protective in dry winters, and the non-greasy Olivem 1000 base keeps it comfortable in humid summers. <strong>For peak winter dryness</strong>, use a slightly more generous amount and consider layering a face oil at night to seal it in.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does one jar last?",
            "answer": "<p>With once-daily use (pea-sized amount), one 50ml jar lasts approximately 2–3 months. For twice-daily use, expect around 6–8 weeks. The <strong>2-bottle protocol</strong> is designed around one complete barrier repair cycle — enough time to see structural change.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
